\begin{theorem}[Berndtsson \cite{Berndtsson09}] \label{Thm:PosBundle}
	Let $p:X\to Y$ be a proper holomorphic submersion from a K\"ahler manifold $X$ to a connected complex manifold $Y$. Let $(L,h)$ be a semi-positive Hermitian holomorphic line bundle over $X$. Then the induced $L^2$ metric on the direct image bundle $p_*(K_{X/Y}\otimes L)$ is Nakano semi-positive.
